Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-17-2000||11:43 AM||||I'm trying to gather info on various hedder configurations. I've got Pipe length and diameter for Sprint.. any one got a Pic and/or specs for the FOCOA pieces, Sabrex etc.. any assistance would be greatly appreciated... ||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierosound||03-18-2000||11:58 AM||||From what I've found, it seems the headers offered by Sabex Racing, West Coast Fieros, RS Motorsports are all FOCOA headers (or copies).  Fiero Store offers Sprint headers.  I've only seen those two configurations.  Pics are available at their websites.  Try using Ask Jeeves ( <A HREF="http://www.aj.com" TARGET=_blank>www.aj.com</A>  ) when you need to search for something.<P><BR>West Coast - <A HREF="http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html</A> <P>Sabex Racing  -  <A HREF="http://web.idirect.com/~sabex/catalog.html" TARGET=_blank>http://web.idirect.com/~sabex/catalog.html</A> <P>RS Motorsports  -  <A HREF="http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/" TARGET=_blank>http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/</A> <P>Fiero Store -  <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierostore.com/</A> ||||reg||10
